-# publish changes model

#publish-changes-model.modal.fade{"aria-hidden" => "true", "aria-labelledby" => "myModalLabel", :role => "dialog", :tabindex => "-1"}
  .modal-dialog.publish-changes-dialog
    .modal-content.publish-changes-content
      .modal_screen1
        %h1.publish-changes-screen-context
          Once you have made changes, the property's touchscreen app
          %br
          will need to be closed
          %br
          and re-opened to make the changes live.
      .modal_screen2.publish-changes-screen-context.hidden
        %img{:alt => "Smiley face", :src => "/assets/publish changes_slide 2.png"}/
      .modal_screen3.publish-changes-screen-context.hidden
        %img{:alt => "Smiley face", :src => "/assets/publish changes_slide 3.png"}/
      .modal_screen4.publish-changes-screen-context.hidden
        %img{:alt => "Smiley face", :src => "/assets/publish changes_slide 4.png"}/
      .modal_screen5.hidden
        %h1.publish-changes-screen-context
          That's it! Once those steps have followed,
          %br
          your changes will be live.
      .modal_next_button1.publish-changes-screen-btn
        %button.btn.btn-success{:class =>"publish_changes_btn1 publish_changes_btn", :type => "button"} NEXT
      .modal_next_button2.publish-changes-screen-btn.hidden
        %button.btn.btn-success{:class =>"publish_changes_btn2 publish_changes_btn", :type => "button"} Next
      .modal_next_button3.publish-changes-screen-btn.hidden
        %button.btn.btn-success{:class =>"publish_changes_btn3 publish_changes_btn", :type => "button"} Next
      .modal_next_button4.publish-changes-screen-btn.hidden
        %button.btn.btn-success{:class =>"publish_changes_btn4 publish_changes_btn", :type => "button"} Next
      .modal_next_button5.publish-changes-screen-btn.hidden
        %button.btn.btn-success{"data-dismiss" => "modal",:class =>"publish_changes_btn5 publish_changes_btn", :type => "button"} OK

